            </note>
            <note corresp="#d598-f3" n="3" xml:id="d598-f3-content">
                <p>Dated Apr. 2; for text of paragraphs 168–171 and 173–180, see <ref
                        target="frus1952-54v15p1#pg_850">pp. 850</ref>–<ref
                        target="frus1952-54v15p1#pg_857">857</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d598-f4" n="4" xml:id="d598-f4-content">
                <p>For NSC Action No. 759, see the memorandum of
                    discussion at the 139th meeting of the NSC, Apr.
                    8, <ref target="frus1952-54v15p1#pg_892">p. 892</ref>.</p>
            </note>
